    streaming is available
```

### Existing Tests
**Location**: `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec/packages/web-ui/tests/api-static.test.ts` (lines 248-268)

There is a dedicated test suite for AC-22:

```typescript
// AC: @gh-pages-export ac-22
describe('static sessions behavior (@gh-pages-export ac-22)', () => {
	beforeEach(() => {
		modeState.staticMode = true;
	});

