- No tests for specific session route navigation (`/sessions`, `/sessions/:id`)
- No tests verifying the message content/wording is user-friendly and informative
- No visual regression tests or component-level tests for the read-only UI
- No tests for graceful error handling in session components when data unavailable

The **API-level tests exist and work correctly**, but **UI-level tests are missing** for how users actually see the informative message on the sessions routes.

